/* Cocaine — Power (triggers, screen off, Shortcuts) — zh-Hant */

"Turn the screen off instead" = "改為關閉螢幕";
"The Mac keeps working with the screen off." = "螢幕關閉時 Mac 繼續工作。";
"While Cocaine is on. Any key or click turns the screen back on. The Mac locks as set in Lock Screen settings." = "在 Cocaine 開啟時。按任意鍵或按一下即可重新點亮螢幕。Mac 依「鎖定畫面」設定鎖定。";
"Turn the screens off now" = "立即關閉螢幕";
"Power" = "電源";
"On while the Mac is on the charger, or on battery above a level; off 30 seconds after" = "Mac 接上充電器時，或使用電池且電量高於某一程度時開啟；30 秒後關閉";
"On the charger" = "接上充電器";
"External display" = "外接顯示器";
"On while a display is connected (or while none is); off 30 seconds after" = "連接顯示器時（或未連接時）開啟；30 秒後關閉";
"Not connected" = "未連接";
"Schedule" = "時間表";
"On during these hours on the chosen days; off when they end" = "在所選日期的這些時段開啟；結束時關閉";
"Hours" = "時段";
"Ends the next day" = "隔天結束";
"Local time; follows daylight saving and time-zone changes" = "本地時間；隨夏令時間與時區變更";
"Turn on when" = "開啟條件";
"Any: one reason is enough. All: every chosen one must hold." = "任一：一個條件即可。全部：所選條件都須符合。";
"All are true" = "全部符合";
"Any is true" = "任一符合";
"Shortcuts app and links" = "「捷徑」App 和連結";
"Lets the Shortcuts app and cocaine:// links turn Cocaine on and off without asking. Off: Cocaine asks you first." = "允許「捷徑」App 和 cocaine:// 連結無需詢問即可開關 Cocaine。關閉時 Cocaine 會先詢問你。";
"Allow Shortcuts and links to control Cocaine?" = "允許「捷徑」和連結控制 Cocaine 嗎？";
"Something opened “%@”. If it wasn't you, choose Don't Allow. You can change this in Automation → Shortcuts." = "有程式打開了「%@」。如果不是你，請選擇「不允許」。可在「自動化」→「快速鍵」中更改。";
"Don't Allow" = "不允許";
"Too hot with the lid closed: Cocaine is off" = "闔上時過熱：Cocaine 已關閉";
